      "Grid: dx = 10000.0 [m]  dy = 10000.0 [m]\n",
      "cg = 8.0 [m s-1]\n",
      "Ld = 80000.0 [m]\n",
      "Scales: Ls=epsilon/D/beta = None [m]\n",
      "Scales: Lx/Ld = 31.25\n",
      "Res: Ld/dx = 8.0\n",
